{"sections":[{"slug":"对偶(范畴论)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对偶(范畴论)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"对偶 (范畴论)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴的对偶是将其中的态射方向反转得到的范畴</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}(X,Y) := \\mathcal C(Y,X).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">取对偶</span> $(-)^{\\mathrm{op}}\\colon \\mathsf{Cat} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自同构</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自同构群为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/2$, <span lang=\"zh\">仅有的非平凡自同构为取对偶</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, $(\\infty,n)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty ,n)}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自同构群为</span> $(\\mathbb{Z}/2)^n$, <span lang=\"zh\">对应在</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个层级上取对偶</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}